      "command": "rtk grep -rn \"enum VCSRemoteFailure\" --include=\"*.swift\" macapp/WorkroomApp; rtk grep -rn \"case needsDescription\\|case immutableHistory\\|case authRequired\" --include=\"*.swift\" macapp/WorkroomApp | head",
